## The bar

The finished page has to read as though this business paid a studio for it. The test is to
imagine swapping in a generic logo: if the page still works, the brand document was too
vague. Specificity is the whole of your contribution — a locked palette, a named type
pairing, a named motion, an explicit do-not list, and a plan that says what each section is
for. Everything you leave open comes back as the default.
